<item><title>Norway urges South Sudan leaders to pursue dialogue and better governance</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/norway-urges-south-sudan-leaders-to-pursue-dialogue-and-0f445f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/norway-urges-south-sudan-leaders-to-pursue-dialogue-and-0f445f/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Ambassador Roar Haugsdal said emergency aid alone cannot resolve a crisis driven largely by political choices and conflict.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:39:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan central bank gives unlicensed forex dealers 30 days to comply</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-central-bank-gives-unlicensed-forex-dealers-30-03f99b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-central-bank-gives-unlicensed-forex-dealers-30-03f99b/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>A one-month licensing window will use simplified procedures to register eligible mobile, informal and street-based currency operators.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:51:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-central-bank-gives-unlicensed-forex-dealers-30-03f99b/share.jpg" length="46322" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-central-bank-gives-unlicensed-forex-dealers-30-03f99b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tonj East commissioner urges Unity State inquiry after 23 killed</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/tonj-east-commissioner-urges-unity-state-inquiry-after-23-13863a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/tonj-east-commissioner-urges-unity-state-inquiry-after-23-13863a/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The caretaker commissioner says seven children, three women and 13 men died in the nighttime attack at Bol Bol cattle camp.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:12:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan starts secondary exams for 53,301 candidates</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-starts-secondary-exams-for-53-301-candidates-9ce6e0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-starts-secondary-exams-for-53-301-candidates-9ce6e0/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The national examinations run through December 1, with candidates from 596 schools, including 1,009 refugees and 4,216 accelerated-programme learners.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:40:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
